{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>World In The Abyss</strong>\u00a0is a survival game where you explore the mystical post apocalyptic underwater world. Build bases and defend against wave of enemies. Craft items, fight bosses and explore the different biomes.\u00a0Dive deeper and deeper into the ocean to find the answers you are looking for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/Explore_border.gif?t=1745863239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUILD YOUR BASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select the best place to build your ocean fort and select interior that best fits your home. Build melters, bruwers, armory, kitchens, beehives and many more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/Build_base_border.gif?t=1745863239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEFEND YOUR BASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To survive, you\u2019ll need to defend your base from raiders roaming the ocean surface. They attack in waves, so make sure your traps and defenses are locked in and ready</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/Defend_base_border.gif?t=1745863239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FIGHT BOSSES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the depths of this mysterious world and uncover the locations of powerful bosses. You\u2019ll need to be prepared, geared up, and ready to face the unknown if you want to survive the fight and uncover what lies beneath</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/Boss_border.gif?t=1745863239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SCAVENGE AND FIND RESOURCES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drill for oil and minerals. Setup grab cages and fishing nets. Blow away sand on the bottom of the ocean floor to discover hidden boxes. Weld open locked doors or blow them up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/Resources_border.gif?t=1745863239\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3676080?t=1745863239","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3676080?t=1745863239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/8d3b2ba5a548e59b9b9cfcea178f9806484ec342/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745863239","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/8d3b2ba5a548e59b9b9cfcea178f9806484ec342/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745863239","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains some violent action scenes with blood"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>World In The Abyss</strong>\u00a0is a survival game where you explore the mystical post apocalyptic underwater world. Build bases and defend against wave of enemies. Craft items, fight bosses and explore the different biomes.\u00a0Dive deeper and deeper into the ocean to find the answers you are looking for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/Explore_border.gif?t=1745863239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUILD YOUR BASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select the best place to build your ocean fort and select interior that best fits your home. Build melters, bruwers, armory, kitchens, beehives and many more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/Build_base_border.gif?t=1745863239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEFEND YOUR BASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To survive, you\u2019ll need to defend your base from raiders roaming the ocean surface. They attack in waves, so make sure your traps and defenses are locked in and ready</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/Defend_base_border.gif?t=1745863239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FIGHT BOSSES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the depths of this mysterious world and uncover the locations of powerful bosses. You\u2019ll need to be prepared, geared up, and ready to face the unknown if you want to survive the fight and uncover what lies beneath</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/Boss_border.gif?t=1745863239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SCAVENGE AND FIND RESOURCES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drill for oil and minerals. Setup grab cages and fishing nets. Blow away sand on the bottom of the ocean floor to discover hidden boxes. Weld open locked doors or blow them up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/Resources_border.gif?t=1745863239\" /></p>","developers":["Lazy Cat Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"des